    "text": "<p>The condition to be imposed on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>β</mi></math>, so that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>)</mo></math> lies on or insideof&nbsp; the triangle having equation of sides as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, is</p>\r"
